    "Nhập đủ dài, rộng, cao (từ 1 đến 1.000 cm), hoặc để trống cả ba.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isi panjang, lebar, dan tinggi (1–1.000 cm), atau kosongkan ketiganya."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "กรอกความยาว ความกว้าง และความสูงให้ครบ (1–1,000 cm) หรือเว้นว่างทั้งสามช่อง"
